            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "coltynzgramz"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love Pool Hall Slaw, although my recipe differs somewhat because I do not like the sweetness the sugars add. I increase the yellow mustard to about 5cups and delete the sugar. It is still very delicious on burgers, hot dogs, vegetables and other sandwiches, but without the sweetness."
          },
